---
title: Loops
description: Forever, slowly — for a thing that must say “this is alive” while nothing else happens. Float, breathe, spin, pulse, sway, bob, shimmer, tick, blink, Ken Burns, a scan line, an orbit.
eyebrow: Content creation · Elements
source: src/studio/motion.css
---
<p>A loop is the opposite of an in: it never finishes. One per shot, on the thing that is waiting — a tile floating, a dot breathing, a picture still moving after the cut. All stop under reduced motion.</p>
