<p><code>--im-studio-loop-speed</code> sets the slow ones (Ken Burns 18s, the scan 4s, the orbit 6s); <code>--im-studio-focus</code> says where a Ken Burns pushes toward. On the page the same loops are <a href="/motion/animation/#loops">im-spin, im-float…</a>; these are sized in the frame’s em.</p>
